        {"zh": "我找到了一块好石头", "en": "I have found a good stone."},
        {"zh": "我盘在这儿等热东西", "en": "I coil here to wait for warmth."},
        {"zh": "砂子从我身上滑落", "en": "Sand slides off my body."},
        {"zh": "我的影子细得像条线", "en": "My shadow is thin as a line."}
